	(descr "Shou Han PJ-313D, 3.5mm stereo (TRS) jack, horizontal, SMD, no switch, body 11.5 x 6 x 5mm + Ø5 x 2.5mm bushing, 6 feet (each contact has a foot on both sides), 2 locating pegs Ø1.1. Drawn from Shou Han drawing HJ-313D (2020-08-24, LCSC C668608 datasheet): pads A/B/C at 1.8/5.0/8.5 from the body front face, pegs at 2.5/8.5, rows 9.0 outer / 5.5 inner. Origin = body centre (excl. bushing), bushing points -X. A=S, B=R, C=T (C deepest). JLCPCB C668608, Economic and Standard.")
